 The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 
+## AI agent form tools
+
+The sign-in and sign-up pages expose `sign_in` and `sign_up` through the
+[WebMCP declarative API](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/webmcp/declarative-api)
+in browsers with WebMCP enabled. Each tool accepts required string parameters
+`username` and `password` and submits the visible form through its existing
+client-side handler. Tools are available while their respective forms are mounted.
+Submission returns `{ success, message }` after the request completes; credentials
+and server tokens are not included in tool results. Registration passwords must
+be at least eight characters and contain a number, as required by the service.
+Browsers without WebMCP continue to use the forms normally.
+
 ## Tech Stack
 
 - **[Astro](https://astro.build/)**: The web framework for building content-driven websites.
